  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2100345346}
  m_Text: 'Fan Product Manual


    Disconnect power before opening the guard. Trace
    the power cord to the fuse holder, identify the working replacement fuse, install
    it, then use the speed control for the neutral device test.'
